---
/** F1: "Out of the box" vs "With the toolkit", four short lines each. */
const before = [
  'Sees one file or one repo at a time',
  'Doesn’t know the team’s standards',
  'Can’t see production logs',
  'No idea how the services connect',
];
const after = [
  'Reads a context doc for every service it touches',
  'Follows written-down standards and checklists',
  'Searches logs through approved tools',
  'Stops for a person before anything irreversible',
];
---

<figure class="ba" data-wide>
  <div class="cols">
    <div class="col before">
      <p class="head">Out of the box</p>
      <ul role="list">
        {
          before.map((t) => (
            <li>
              <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M4 4l8 8M12 4l-8 8" />
              </svg>
              <span>{t}</span>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div class="col after">
      <p class="head">With the toolkit</p>
      <ul role="list">
        {
          after.map((t, i) => (
            <li class:list={{ gated: i === after.length - 1 }}>
              <svg viewBox="0 0 16 16" width="16" height="16" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M3 8.5l3.2 3L13 4.5" />
              </svg>
              <span>{t}</span>
            </li>
          ))
        }
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
  <figcaption>The model is the same in both columns. What changes is the context it reads and the actions it is allowed to take.</figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .ba {
    margin: var(--s-7) 0;
  }
  .cols {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--s-3);
  }
  .col {
    padding: var(--s-5);
    border-radius: var(--r-lg);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .before {
    background: var(--surface-2);
  }
  .after {
    background: var(--surface);
    border-color: var(--accent);
    box-shadow: inset 0 4px 0 var(--accent);
  }
  .head {
    margin-bottom: var(--s-4);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: var(--fs-label);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .after .head {
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  ul {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--s-3);
    margin: 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
  }
  li {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 20px 1fr;
    gap: var(--s-3);
    align-items: start;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }
  svg {
    margin-top: 0.2em;
    fill: none;
    stroke-width: 2;
    stroke-linecap: round;
    stroke-linejoin: round;
  }
  .before svg {
    stroke: var(--muted);
  }
  .before li {
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .after svg {
    stroke: var(--accent);
  }
  .after li.gated svg {
    stroke: var(--gate);
  }
  figcaption {
    margin-top: var(--s-3);
    font-size: var(--fs-small);
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  @media (min-width: 720px) {
    .cols {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>
